note('Author page 21; archive number 39. The page specifies generators and relations for graph VII, draws the labelled sphere, and writes the images under u. The generator a in (71) has a headless connector; its arrowhead is not supplied. The first inverse in (72) visibly places the prime after ω, unlike the prime-before-ω form of (71); the two plain d factors in the second relation also remain as written. These discrepancies were noticed by following sources and targets, but no textual repair is justified. The marginal counts are “six relations indépendantes” for the first family and “en apparence six relations, mais il n’y en a que trois indépendantes” for the second. They are transcribed claims, not independently proved counts. Formula (74) has the expected rearrangement obtained by applying ε0 inverse and left-multiplying by λ inverse; this checks the displayed factor order. The leading β of (75) is cancelled. The last line reads the grammatically awkward “Cette relations”; it continues on the next scan. The doubled closing parenthesis after (65 a) is preserved.')
